The generator bundles Eclipse Layout Kernel 0.12.0 (core, graph, alg.common,
alg.layered and alg.mrtree) and the Xtext Xbase library 2.44.0 under the
Eclipse Public License 2.0. Their corresponding source is available at
https://github.com/eclipse-elk/elk/tree/v0.12.0 and
https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/org/eclipse/xtext/org.eclipse.xtext.xbase.lib/2.44.0/org.eclipse.xtext.xbase.lib-2.44.0-sources.jar

The generator also bundles Eclipse Modeling Framework common, ecore and
ecore.xmi 2.12.0 under the Eclipse Public License 1.0. The corresponding
source JARs are available in each module's 2.12.0 directory at
https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2/org/eclipse/emf/

Both Eclipse licence texts are included in META-INF/licenses.
